n."},"questions":[{"id":"pairs","type":"pairwise","label":{"he":"מה מייצג יותר את החתונה שלכם?","en":"Which represents your wedding better?"},"pairs":[{"id":"disco_vs_house","a":{"value":"disco","label":{"he":"דיסקו קלאסי של שנות ה־70","en":"70s disco classics"}},"b":{"value":"house","label":{"he":"האוס עכשווי","en":"Contemporary house"}}},{"id":"mizrahi_vs_intl","a":{"value":"mizrahi","label":{"he":"מזרחית ישראלית","en":"Israeli Mizrahi"}},"b":{"value":"intl_pop","label":{"he":"פופ בינלאומי","en":"International pop"}}},{"id":"throwback_vs_now","a":{"value":"throwback","label":{"he":"נוסטלגיה של שנות ה־90","en":"90s nostalgia"}},"b":{"value":"current","label":{"he":"הלהיטים של עכשיו","en":"Today’s hits"}}},{"id":"rock_vs_rnb","a":{"value":"rock","label":{"he":"רוק לשירה בציבור","en":"Sing-along rock"}},"b":{"value":"rnb","label":{"he":"R&B והיפ־הופ","en":"R&B & hip-hop"}}},{"id":"live_vs_electronic","a":{"value":"organic","label":{"he":"צליל אורגני וחי","en":"Organic, live sound"}},"b":{"value":"electronic","label":{"he":"צליל אלקטרוני מודרני","en":"Modern electronic sound"}}}]},{"id":"adventurous","type":"scale","min":1,"max":5,"label":{"he":"כמה הדיג׳יי יכול להיות הרפתקן?","en":"How adventurous can the DJ be?"},"minLabel":{"he":"צמוד לבקשות","en":"Stick to our list"},"maxLabel":{"he":"חופש מלא","en":"Full freedom"}},{"id":"dj_notes","type":"text","multiline":true,"maxLength":2000,"label":{"he":"עוד משהו שהדיג׳יי צריך לדעת?","en":"Anything else your DJ should know?"}}]},{"id":"restrictions","kind":"restrictions","letter":"E","title":{"he":"חובה / לעולם לא","en":"Must play / Never play"},"intro":{"he":"מה חייב להתנגן — ומה אסור שיתנגן, בשום מצב.","en":"What must be played — and what must never be played."},"questions":[]},{"id":"moments","kind":"moments","letter":"F","title":{"he":"הרגעים המיוחדים","en":"Special moments"},"intro":{"he":"כניסות, שבירת הכוס, ריקוד ראשון ועוד.","en":"Entrances, breaking the glass, first dance and more."},"questions":[]},{"id":"brief","